{
  "id": "ss.relic.frenzy",
  "name": "Feeding frenzy",
  "description": "A maw a little wider than it is tall, lips lumpy rather than true, set with nine pale teeth that all lean the same way — every tooth's point is swung forty degrees clockwise off the line to the centre, so the ring turns as you look at it. The middle is not a throat: a red tongue with a coral crown fills it to the roots of the teeth, because a dark hole inside a ring of anything bright is an eye or a pit and this is a mouth still full. Kills that follow one another quickly are what stack the damage, and a whirl of teeth is a mouth that is not stopping. The teeth vary in size and three of them stand proud of the lip so the silhouette is spiky and turning, not a coin.",
